# Validates a nested ts_config whose nearest package.json is in a Bazel package
# with js_tsconfig_package_deps disabled:
# - app/ has a hand-written js_library carrying its package.json, under a name
#   gazelle would not pick. app/child's ts_config MUST depend on it.
# - other/ has none, so other/child's ts_config MUST NOT reference
#   other/package.json (gazelle warns instead).
